# display_present_gamma: A gamma table with opcode 7: entryCount <= 1024 and 4 x count <= mappedLength, else a throw before the frame; a checksum mismatch raises in DisplayCore::update_gamma_table_locked after mode_change, so the present is not counted. A good table is stored at +0xf80 and switches the display to the gamma shader for good; a table of another size re-creates the table texture. The mapped length is always at least 12 x count: the host reads 12 x count bytes.
